    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i feel like i'm just a ghost in this house. i see him everywhere, but it's just a memory. it would be so much easier to just... stop feeling this. to just be with him so i don't have to carry this heavy, gray emptiness anymore. do you think it's wrong to want that? to just want the pain to end?",
